sequenceDiagram
    participant EXTI as Pin 22 (DATA_READY)
    participant CS as Pin 24 (SPI1_CS0)
    participant CLK as Pin 23 (SPI1_SCK)
    participant MISO as Pin 21 (SPI1_MISO)

    Note over EXTI,MISO: Idle State: EXTI=Low, CS=High, CLK=Low
    EXTI->>EXTI: Drive HIGH (STM32 Signals Ready)
    Note over CS: Jetson Hard IRQ -> Workqueue Delay
    CS->>CS: Drive LOW (Jetson Asserts Control)
    CLK->>CLK: 1 MHz Clock Pulses Generate
    MISO->>MISO: 36 Bytes Shifted Out
    CS->>CS: Drive HIGH (Jetson Releases Bus)
    EXTI->>EXTI: Drive LOW (STM32 Clears Signal)
